WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:07.470
Early in 1915, Djevdet Bey,
governor of Van,

2
00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:12.254
demanded 4,000 Armenian men
for the army's labor battalions.

3
00:00:12.294 --> 00:00:15.332
Van's Armenians understood
what was coming.

4
00:00:15.692 --> 00:00:20.502
Two self-defense committees formed,
in Aygestan, the garden quarter,

5
00:00:20.542 --> 00:00:23.419
and in the walled city
beneath Van Rock.

6
00:00:23.779 --> 00:00:26.725
Aram Manukian stood
among their leaders.

7
00:00:26.765 --> 00:00:31.804
About 1,500 fighters
had only some 300 modern rifles.

8
00:00:31.844 --> 00:00:36.135
From 20 April, the Ottoman guns
opened on both quarters.

9
00:00:36.495 --> 00:00:39.485
For four weeks, shells fell on homes,

10
00:00:39.525 --> 00:00:42.822
on the American mission
and on Dr Ussher's hospital.

11
00:00:43.182 --> 00:00:46.092
In mid-May the besiegers
began to pull back,

12
00:00:46.132 --> 00:00:49.930
and Armenian volunteers
and the Russian army rode in.

13
00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:52.700
The defenders saved
the city's Armenians

14
00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:56.274
from the massacres that destroyed
the villages around them.

15
00:00:56.634 --> 00:01:01.131
Hold every wall and every garden
until the riders come.

